Each future run (P15 v2) reads this file first, picks at least 2 UNTRIED angles, and writes its rows to its own OUT/ANGLES.md; the master merges them here. Strength: S = holds in a within-author contrast or across 90 with a clear median gap; M = across-90 gap but confounded; W = single task or heuristic only; N = tried, no signal.

