/Users/mac/Desktop/Terminal Bench/beta-task-generator/BETA-GENERATOR-HANDBOOK.md:3:This is the operator's book for the local Beta Task Generator. It is written for a person who wants to ask an agent for work in ordinary English, understand what the agent and the controller each do, and use the exact command-line interface when needed. The generator helps create, review, harden, and package difficult but fair Harbor input bundles. It does not automatically call a model, run Harbor, install software, or publish anything.
